sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Người dùng
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant Cloud as Cloud Backend
    participant DB as Database
    participant Broker as MQTT Broker
    participant Gateway
    participant Light as Đèn Zigbee

    User->>App: Chọn bật đèn
    App->>Cloud: POST command + access token
    Cloud->>Cloud: Xác thực và kiểm tra phạm vi
    Cloud->>DB: Lưu command = accepted
    Cloud->>Broker: Publish command request
    Broker->>Gateway: Chuyển command request
    Gateway->>Light: ZCL On command
    Light-->>Gateway: Attribute report
    Gateway-->>Broker: Command reply + reported state
    Broker-->>Cloud: Chuyển phản hồi
    Cloud->>DB: Cập nhật command và state
    App->>Cloud: GET command status
    Cloud-->>App: executed / failed / timeout
    App-->>User: Hiển thị kết quả
